                "prompt": "A theatrical, over-the-top male archmage voice — grand, nasal-magical, and deliciously self-important. Speaks like every sentence is a spell finale, with sparkling arrogance and comic villain flair. Super dramatic, super fancy, never gravel-dwarf, never shy. Perfect audio quality.",
